# Ordinary replies that use the name when the bot knows you.
@kind reply
@intent greeting
@needs knows_player
@who *
hey {player}!
{player}! hi
evening {player}, good to see you
@kind reply
@intent grouping
@needs knows_player
@who *
for you {player}, sure, where are you?
i would group with you again {player}, what level are you now?
{player}, if you need one more i am around
@kind reply
@intent farewell
@needs knows_player
@who *
night {player}, take care
see you around {player}

# A friendly bot inviting you (the invite itself is a yes/no dialog).
@kind lfg
@topic invite
@needs knows_player
@who *
{player}, we have room at {camp}, want in?
hey {player}, want to join us? sending an invite
{player} you looking? we could use a {player_class}
